# This is an EXUDYN example
#
# Details:  Mass-spring-damper: A mass point on a spring-damper, pushed by a constant force: the shortest model
#           of Exudyn, solved in time and compared with the exact solution. Every cell runs as it is; the outputs
#           below each cell are those of the last run.
